{"server":"jp","storyId":"act3d0_ui_act3d0_campselect","groupId":"act3d0","stageId":"a003_st01","title":"祭りの幕開け","storyCode":"ENTRY","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/ui_act3d0_campselect.txt","sourceHash":"a4639fa4cc8ebf38d02e6305b6232c90a46ac59bffeb94c0cdccfe7417e7c41c","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第一关（前）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac3_title1"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_Festival_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"司会者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"年に一度のシエスタの祭典、黒曜石祭ことオブシディアンフェスティバルにようこそ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"司会者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"シエスタの皆様！　ノッてますか？"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"観客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（熱狂的な歓声）うぉおおおおおお！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"司会者","speakerId":"avg_npc_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"このフェスでは、種族はなに？　出身はどこ？　そーんなの関係ぇ、あ・り・ま・せ・ん！　すべて忘れて今日からドーンと盛り上がりましょう！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"司会者","speakerId":"avg_npc_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"フェスに必要なのはただ一つ！　皆様の情熱だけです！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"司会者","speakerId":"avg_npc_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"さぁ、その手を掲げて燃え上がる皆様の情熱をブチ上げましょう！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"観客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（熱狂的な歓声）うぉおおおおおお！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"司会者","speakerId":"avg_npc_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"そして！　今年も最注目アーティスト賞の選考を行います！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"司会者","speakerId":"avg_npc_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"皆様、どんなに熱く盛り上がっても、推しアーティストへの<color=#ee4321>投票</color>をお忘れなきようお願いいたします。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"司会者","speakerId":"avg_npc_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"投票の<color=#ee4321>チャンスは一度きり</color>です。投票後は変更することはできませんので、ご注意ください！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"司会者","speakerId":"avg_npc_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"ですがご安心ください、あなたが投票したアーティストの得票数に関わらず、報酬の量には<color=#ee4321>影響しません</color>！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"司会者","speakerId":"avg_npc_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"投票後<color=#ee4321>全てのミッション</color>を達成するだけで、それに応じたボーナスアイテムが獲得できます！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"観客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（熱狂的な歓声）うぉおおおおおお！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"司会者","speakerId":"avg_npc_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"ですので、あれこれ悩まれることなく、いち早く一番好きなアーティストに貴重な一票を入れてください！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"司会者","speakerId":"avg_npc_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"では投票をお願いします！！　あなたの一番好きなアーティストを教えてください！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
